<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila can withstand short-term peso aberrations.</title>
<headline>Manila can withstand short-term peso aberrations.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine economy can withstand short-term aberrations in the currency market given its healthy budget position, low inflation, and steady economic growth, Finance Secretary Roberto de Ocampo told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The economy does have enough depth and strength to withstand the short-term aberrations being brought about by short-term speculators,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
